{'symbol': 'SWKS', 'date': '2023-05-18 16:30:00', 'title': 'BETTERINVESTING™ MAGAZINE UPDATE ON BOOKING HOLDINGS INC. AND SKYWORKS SOLUTIONS INC.', 'text': 'TROY, MICH. , MAY 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE EDITORIAL ADVISORY AND SECURITIES REVIEW COMMITTEE OF BETTERINVESTING MAGAZINE TODAY ANNOUNCED BOOKING HOLDINGS INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: BKNG) AS ITS "STOCK TO STUDY" AND SKYWORKS SOLUTIONS INC. (NASDAQ: SWKS) AS ITS "UNDERVALUED STOCK" IN THE AUGUST 2023 ISSUE FOR INVESTORS\' INFORMATIONAL AND EDUCATIONAL USE.'}